menu "Sprout feature modules"

config FEATURE_ALARM_REMINDER
    bool "Enable alarm reminder cache and local firing state"
    default y
    help
        Caches a bounded set of family alarms (local time of day, weekday set,
        enable flag, snooze window, label and optional prompt), persists them
        across restarts, and tracks the local firing state so the device rings
        at most once per day and reports ringing/snoozed/dismissed/missed back
        to the parent app's alarm reminders.

endmenu
